WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.134 --> 00:00:02.702
People get real quiet when you start talking about recovery.

2
00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.499
They love the success story, but they

3
00:00:04.499 --> 00:00:06.297
don't like the part where you had

4
00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.094
to crawl through hell to get there.

5
00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:09.378
Let me tell you something.

6
00:00:09.798 --> 00:00:13.006
I'm not hiding my story to make anybody comfortable.

7
00:00:13.006 --> 00:00:14.075
I lived addiction.

8
00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:15.144
I lived chaos.

9
00:00:15.144 --> 00:00:17.639
I lived jail cells, funerals, and whole

10
00:00:17.639 --> 00:00:19.778
nights wondering if I'd wake up.

11
00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:22.156
And now that I'm clean, people

12
00:00:22.156 --> 00:00:24.147
want me to whisper about it.

13
00:00:24.147 --> 00:00:25.142
Nah, not happening.

14
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:27.796
I'm breaking that stigma every time I speak.

15
00:00:27.796 --> 00:00:31.113
Because the truth is, there are people out there dying

16
00:00:31.113 --> 00:00:34.431
in silence because they're scared to be judged for healing.

17
00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:35.426
Think about that.

18
00:00:35.846 --> 00:00:38.591
People will clown you for getting clean, but

19
00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:40.993
stay quiet when you're destroying your life.

20
00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:43.052
That's the world we live in.

21
00:00:43.052 --> 00:00:44.425
So hear me clearly.

22
00:00:44.425 --> 00:00:46.827
You don't owe anyone a pretty recovery.

23
00:00:46.827 --> 00:00:49.572
You don't owe anyone a fake version of

24
00:00:49.572 --> 00:00:51.974
your journey to make them feel safe.

25
00:00:51.974 --> 00:00:53.347
Your story is real.

26
00:00:53.347 --> 00:00:54.719
Your scars are real.

27
00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:56.092
Your comeback is real.

28
00:00:56.358 --> 00:00:57.730
And the more you speak up,

29
00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:00.959
the more people realize addiction doesn't look one way.

30
00:01:00.959 --> 00:01:02.249
It looks like me.

31
00:01:02.249 --> 00:01:03.540
It looks like you.

32
00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.154
It looks like real people

33
00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:07.380
who decided they wanted better.

34
00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.090
If you're done being silent,

35
00:01:09.574 --> 00:01:12.469
if you're done being ashamed of the work you're

36
00:01:12.469 --> 00:01:15.042
doing, drop a heart and stand with me.

37
00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:18.313
We're breaking this stigma, loud and unfiltered.

38
00:01:18.313 --> 00:01:20.418
Let's build something and rise.
